    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Not long ago, two of my grandchildren came over for a Sunday night family dinner. They walked in and made straight for the sofa to lie down. Aged 10 and 12, they pulled out their smartphones and started gaming. It saddens me to watch them, and so many other kids today, "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "define",
            "ref": "v-define"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " gaming as play. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When I wanted a metal "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pedal car",
            "zh": "踏板车"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " like some of my rich friends, my father made me one out of wood. It had wooden wheels and was pushed along the sidewalk using a broken "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "hockey",
            "zh": "曲棍球"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " stick on the back. At first, I was "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ashamed",
            "ref": "v-ashamed"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of the homemade toy. But I soon began to like it when my friends all wanted a ride. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " When I was older, he made me a high jump stand. Dad just loved building things, or he really loved me, or maybe a little of both."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " For "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "entertainment",
            "ref": "v-entertainment"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", we had to get creative. We put up tents in the backyard and camped out. At night, we looked for adventures on the streets. We once went on a week-long bike trip to Lake Huron (it’s 220 kilometres away)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "My grandchildren have no idea how much fun these activities can be. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The first response was, “Why did we have to put our shoes on and go outside?” “Because I wanted to show you something,” I said, and picked up my "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "frisbee",
            "zh": "飞盘"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “I thought we could go outside and throw the frisbee around.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I got a slow, "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "reluctant",
            "ref": "v-reluctant"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " “Sure” for my efforts."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "With some further unwillingness, we walked out into the street and began throwing the frisbee back and forth badly. “Bend your wrist,” I "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "instructed",
            "ref": "v-instruct"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " helpfully."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Slowly, we got the hang of it and hit the neighbour’s car only three times. It’s amazing how much a frisbee hurts when your fingers are cold, but we were making progress. My grandson found three excuses to go inside. Each time, though, his grandma kicked him back out. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It was a great success, I think, but alas, you cannot win a war by winning just one battle."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "label": "",
      "instruction": "Fill in each blank in the article with a proper sentence given below. Each sentence can be used only once. Note that there are two more sentences than you will need.",
      "bank": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "When I was a kid, I knew how to play."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "We played until the neighbour came to check on his car."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "In my neighbourhood, we didn’t have much to play with."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Dad also built a huge playhouse and several tree houses."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "We could organise team sports without help from our parents."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "F",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "My father grew up in the 1940s and had even less as a child to play with."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "G",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "That Sunday night, after dinner, I decided to take them outside to show them something “different”."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
